          "total_marks": 4,
          "stem_markdown": "The widths, $w$ cm, of a random sample of 150 leaves of a certain kind were measured. The sample mean of $w$ was found to be 3.12 cm.\n\nUsing this sample, an approximate 95% confidence interval for the population mean of the widths in centimetres was found to be $[3.01, 3.23]$.",
