          "total_marks": 5,
          "stem_markdown": "The masses in kilograms of large and small bags of cement have the independent distributions $N(50, 2.4)$ and $N(26, 1.8)$ respectively.\n\nFind the probability that the total mass of 5 randomly chosen large bags of cement is greater than the total mass of 10 randomly chosen small bags of cement.",
