              "sequence_number": 9,
              "content_markdown": "$$\\left[\\frac{2x^3}{3} - \\frac{x^5}{5}\\right]_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}$$",
              "guidance_markdown": "Correct integration and correct limits.",
              "source_page_numbers": [
                9
