              "is_final_answer": true,
              "sequence_number": 10,
              "content_markdown": "$$[=\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{3} - \\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{5}] = \\frac{8}{15}\\sqrt{2}$$",
              "guidance_markdown": "OE For single exact term.",
